// FIX 1: frozen var — var lvl = highest(high, 20) freezes at bar 0, plain lvl = highest(high, lvlLen) recomputes every bar.
// FIX 2: future index — close[-1] reads an unformed future bar and repaints, fixed to close vs lvl[1] history only.
// FIX 3: Pine plotshape signature — Pine plotshape(series, style) is invalid, fixed to plotshape(bar_index, price, title, style, color).
